@* The browser tab icon of every page: the Wasla app icon (the wordmark's first letter in white on the orange tile, the
   recipe of Wasla.PrintBridge's WaslaAppIcon). favicon.ico holds 16, 32 and 48 px images for browsers without SVG
   icons; the version query replaces an icon a browser cached earlier. *@
<link rel="icon" href="~/favicon.ico" sizes="32x32" asp-append-version="true" />
<link rel="icon" href="~/images/brand/wasla-app-icon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" asp-append-version="true" />
